{"version":1,"content":"<p>有次，跟一位經營了四十年的餐廳老闆聊天。</p><p>我問：「現在市道那麼差，為甚麼很多連鎖食店依然排長龍？</p><p>」&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;他的答案，有道理，也可悲。</p><p>他說：&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;「客人吃東西，求的是</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.216327+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T04:00:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:24.990611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:24.990611+00:00","content_hash":"385bd0ee905a4e9d646a14749b6bc7eb58073fe7f7f6f17a99f5a62455bdf4a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}